91825546_3047871005399603_1121512230322370963_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1xu5lpozWl0Q7kNvwHszQft&_nc_oc=Adpa1PDihNWd-Lgk2XzzlZ7MWK9f0ZPJJFtuicDDs2hEPFrACwwH6a9FJTDZ5gigbaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQd75GBXPdumhzK935_3G-UZpny5TBlbohhoePj5MQMxg&oe=6AF09CC2"}, {"file_name": "1000029422.png", "id": "958913239837633", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585741071_958913243170966_7305155668895960894_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5YKAoDQNiY8Q7kNvwFjcl9D&_nc_oc=Ado2ScMcZ2vTGewwUAB_irBXtM61-l2bVJktwRz31jmt2yetXoFVI7teyHKAXm3DQuo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRxBiAMkG5CN3hlrRaSrTNTwnGl4gaNt1lU0cWgTgVpjA&oe=6AF08D1F"}, {"file_name": "1000029419.png", "id": "965397222662988", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_965397225996321_9101016007867829404_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dCmyiGHW8BMQ7kNvwEaTcKK&_nc_oc=AdqO1n3vQG6JU2VgHDWAr3cx3yefYulZcRy0JY8yZdFh_Yagqf1pNhUOlIMaDt6c9J0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSlJosBNuoaQ1tj5MmmK0U7j-U487DFGm3rb0f6xd8weg&oe=6AF08A74"}, {"file_name": "1000029423.png", "id": "943154284790213", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821568_943154291456879_7147789068075058944_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oNaAuhGnxeUQ7kNvwHYOF6D&_nc_oc=Adrs5fn7SLS4FdSQABQQuiDZ36opsCPkbKLtnn7KWGEL-QHnmN4wG4uwLs5JvJ_KBRQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQICc3mjnjUq6JzT47tGodoULGiSl2t5baLr0QQAxm60Q&oe=6AF084AA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Project Collision Revamp", "keywords": ["Gorilla", "Collision"], "long_description": "Project Collision \u2014 is a multiplayer virtual reality game where you become a legless gorilla and interact with the world only through the movements of your hands. Break away from reality and immerse yourself in a world of simple, physically active fun.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Key Game Features\n\n\u00b7 Unique Movement: Run, climb, and jump by physically swinging your arms and pushing off surfaces. There are no buttons or joysticks\u2014your body becomes the controller.\n\u00b7 Game Modes for Every Taste: From dynamic competitions to relaxed socializing. Take part in epic team battles in Paintbrawl mode or chase a personal goal in Hunt mode.\n\u00b7 Social Space: Beyond the games, you can simply chat and hang out with friends or new acquaintances in the dedicated non-competitive Casual mode.\n\u00b7 Freedom of Expression: Visit the in-game shop to purchase and wear various hats, glasses, clothing, and other cosmetic items.\n\n\ud83e\udd8d How to Play\n\nThe gameplay is based on intuitive movements:\n\n\u00b7 To run, swing your arms as if you were running in place.\n\u00b7 To jump, simply press your palms against the ground or any surface and push off.\n\u00b7 To climb a tree or ledge, grab onto it with both hands and pull yourself up.\n\nThese simple rules are easy to learn, but it takes practice to become a true parkour master in gorilla form.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Game Worlds\n\nExplore diverse maps, play with friends, and have a blast.", "short_description": "Project Collision \u2014 is a multiplayer virtual reality game where you become a legless gorilla and interact with the world only through the movements of your hands. Break away from reality and immerse yourself in a world of simple, physically active fun"}]}, "developer_name": "Collision Teams", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1V79n4yLR0YVi0e514Hal5yIGxjR3jszbwpDyYvmvumA/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Collision Trams", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CSgkis75_xiJ7yLm4ZS4kHUJ4soUs84hfvwcSjOhBw4/edit?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": 